{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "help-pr-mobile-apis-only",
    "name": "Help PR — Mobile APIs only",
    "description": "Postman collection for **`/api/mobile/*`** (partner app).\n\n**Middleware (all mobile routes)**\n- `mobileRateLimiter` — 1000 req / 15 min per IP → **429** JSON\n- `mobileAuthMiddleware` — Bearer JWT on protected routes → **401**\n\n**Suggested test order**\n1. **Location** (no auth): States → Cities → Areas → Pincodes\n2. **Register** or **Login** → saves `{{token}}`, `{{email}}`\n3. **Catalog** (Bearer): Categories → Services → saves `{{categoryId}}`, `{{serviceId}}`\n4. **Update partner** (Bearer + form-data): select `image` + `aadhar_card` files\n\n**Response shapes**\n- Location & catalog success: `{ success, status, message, records }`\n- Register / login / update success: `{ success, status, message, data }`\n- Errors: `{ success: false, status, message }`\n\n**Files**\n- `middleware/mobile/partner/location_middleware.js` — location query validation\n- `services/mobile/partner/location_service.js` — location data\n- `controllers/mobile/partner/catalog_controller.js` + `catalog_service.js` — franchise-scoped catalog",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Partner",
      "description": "Partner mobile — `routes/mobile/partner/partner_routes.js` + `location_routes.js`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Priya\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"2003-05-23\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"+916309654123\",\n  \"email\": \"partner.mobile+{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Priya@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "register"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/register**\n\n- No Authorization\n- **Required:** name, email, phone_number, password, date_of_birth (18+)\n- Response: `data.auth_token`, `data._id`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_token\": \"{{deviceToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "login"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/login**\n\n- No Authorization\n- **Required:** email, password\n- Optional: device_token"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Location",
          "description": "Public address dropdowns — `location_middleware` + `location_service`. No Bearer. Run: States → Cities → Areas → Pincodes.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "States",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true));",
                      "  const rec = j?.records?.[0];",
                      "  if (rec?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('stateId', String(rec._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/states",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "states"]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/states**\n\n- No auth\n- **200** `{ success, status, message, records }`\n- Empty list is **200** + `records: []`"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Cities",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const rec = j?.records?.[0];",
                      "  if (rec?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('cityId', String(rec._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/cities?state_id={{stateId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "cities"],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "state_id",
                      "value": "{{stateId}}",
                      "description": "Optional — 24-hex ObjectId; comma-separated OK. **400** if present but invalid."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/cities**\n\n- Cities with active franchise in state(s)\n- **400** `Invalid state_id format.` / `Provide at least one valid state_id.`"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Areas",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const rec = j?.records?.[0];",
                      "  if (rec?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('areaId', String(rec._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/areas?city_id={{cityId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "areas"],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "city_id",
                      "value": "{{cityId}}",
                      "description": "Optional — **400** if present but invalid"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "state_id",
                      "value": "{{stateId}}",
                      "disabled": true,
                      "description": "Optional extra filter"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/areas**\n\n- Franchise-linked areas; includes `city_name` when available"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Pincodes",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const pc = j?.records?.[0]?.pincode;",
                      "  if (pc) pm.collectionVariables.set('pincode', String(pc));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/pincodes?area_id={{areaId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "pincodes"],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "area_id",
                      "value": "{{areaId}}",
                      "description": "Required — **400** if missing/invalid"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/pincodes**\n\n- **400** `area_id is required.` | `Invalid area id format.` | `Provide at least one valid area_id.`\n- Use `records[].pincode` **string** in Update `pincode` field"
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Catalog",
          "description": "Franchise-scoped category/service pickers — Bearer required. Run **after Login**. Partner must have `franchise_id` (often set on first successful Update with location).",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Categories",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const rec = j?.records?.[0];",
                      "  if (rec?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', String(rec._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/categories",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "categories"]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/categories**\n\n- **401** without Bearer\n- **400** if partner has no `franchise_id`\n- **200** `records`: `_id`, `name`, `desc`, `image_url`"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Services",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const rec = j?.records?.[0];",
                      "  if (rec?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceId', String(rec._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/services?category_id={{categoryId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "services"],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "category_id",
                      "value": "{{categoryId}}",
                      "description": "Required — **400** if missing/invalid ObjectId"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/services?category_id=**\n\n- **400** `category_id is required.`\n- **404** category not found\n- **403** category not in partner franchise\n- **200** `records`: `_id`, `name`, `desc`, `tax`, `image_url`, `category_id`"
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update partner",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "gender",
                  "value": "female",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required — male | female | other"
                },
                {
                  "key": "experience",
                  "value": "2 years",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required"
                },
                {
                  "key": "state_id",
                  "value": "{{stateId}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required — Mongo ObjectId"
                },
                {
                  "key": "city_id",
                  "value": "{{cityId}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required"
                },
                {
                  "key": "area_id",
                  "value": "{{areaId}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pincode",
                  "value": "{{pincode}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required — string from Pincodes API"
                },
                {
                  "key": "address",
                  "value": "12 MG Road, Hyderabad",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required"
                },
                {
                  "key": "bank_account",
                  "value": "{\"bank_name\":\"HDFC Bank\",\"branch_name\":\"Madhapur\",\"account_holder_name\":\"Neha Sharma\",\"account_number\":\"123456789012\",\"ifsc_code\":\"HDFC0001234\",\"is_primary\":true}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required — JSON string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "partner_services",
                  "value": "[{\"category_id\":\"{{categoryId}}\",\"services\":[{\"service_id\":\"{{serviceId}}\",\"description\":\"Home cleaning\",\"price\":499}]}]",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Required — nested or flat array; see partner_middleware"
                },
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Required — max 512 KB"
                },
                {
                  "key": "aadhar_card",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Required — JPEG/PNG/PDF, max 10 MB"
                },
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "Neha Sharma",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "email",
                  "value": "{{email}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "device_token",
                  "value": "{{deviceToken}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "pan_card",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/update",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "update"]
            },
            "description": "**PUT /api/mobile/partner/update**\n\n- **multipart/form-data** only (Body → form-data; do not set Content-Type manually)\n- **Bearer** `{{token}}`\n\n**Required:** image, aadhar_card, gender, experience, state_id, city_id, area_id, pincode (string), address, partner_services, bank_account\n\n**Note:** If Catalog returns **400** (no franchise), run Update once with location fields — then retry Categories."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
